{"lines":[{"h":0.016404923768801205,"t":"Reading","y":0.039967559699315314,"x":0.8229640321442897,"w":0.080329100290934208,"c":1},{"h":0.016199376947040545,"w":0.17669902801513671,"t":"Questions 14-19","x":0.071844660694506637,"y":0.090031152577026763,"c":1},{"t":"Choose the correct letter, A, B, C or D.","w":0.3669902801513672,"c":1,"h":0.0190302828019282,"y":0.13081395375957672,"x":0.071844665650349568},{"y":0.17005813962887451,"w":0.57475728352864586,"c":1,"x":0.071844659108798503,"t":"Write the correct letter in boxes 14-19 on your answer sheet.","h":0.015988371899566145},{"w":0.64866821289062504,"x":0.06984929823035306,"h":0.02027320742978489,"y":0.20927566950531373,"t":"14 What point does the writer make about Al in the first paragraph?","c":1},{"h":0.014534883112922281,"c":1,"x":0.1165048546962143,"w":0.015533979733784981,"t":"A","y":0.23982558157822875},{"y":0.25872093039121324,"h":0.014534883112922392,"c":1,"x":0.11650485464991943,"t":"B","w":0.017475727399190275},{"c":1,"t":"C","x":0.11650485464991946,"h":0.013081395514657479,"w":0.017475727399190275,"y":0.27761627889341878},{"c":1,"x":0.11650485464991946,"t":"D","w":0.017475727399190275,"h":0.01308139551465759,"y":0.29796511610272103},{"w":0.47378641764322915,"y":0.2398255814877327,"h":0.015988371899566256,"x":0.15922329591561635,"c":1,"t":"It is difficult to predict how quickly Al will progress."},{"h":0.015988371899566145,"x":0.15728156506870694,"y":0.25726744179730998,"w":0.5766990152994792,"t":"Much can be learned about the use of Al in chess machines.","c":1},{"c":1,"x":0.15917578946100017,"y":0.27581433920614074,"w":0.59620508829752605,"t":"The future is unlikely to see limitations on the capabilities of Al.","h":0.018398756698655871},{"h":0.019342390399112896,"x":0.15725034601468432,"t":"Experts disagree on which specialised tasks Al will be able to perform.","w":0.66803675333658852,"c":1,"y":0.29638126269028953},{"t":"15 What is the writer doing in the second paragraph?","h":0.016199376947040434,"c":1,"x":0.069902903388750798,"y":0.32834890994447841,"w":0.51650487263997391},{"h":0.01869157690125467,"t":"explaining why machines will be able to outperform humans","w":0.56330851236979174,"c":1,"x":0.16106527497826797,"y":0.35559667573261367},{"x":0.1145631070502265,"y":0.37645348853074823,"t":"B","w":0.019417475064595527,"c":1,"h":0.014534883112922281},{"t":"C","y":0.39534883699557821,"w":0.017475727399190275,"x":0.11650485464991943,"h":0.01308139551465759,"c":1},{"x":0.11650485464991943,"w":0.017475727399190275,"y":0.41569767457725981,"c":1,"h":0.01453488311292217,"t":"D"},{"h":0.018895348284474811,"c":1,"w":0.59417475382486973,"y":0.37500000027213054,"t":"describing the characteristics that humans and machines share","x":0.16310679774209955},{"y":0.39532710282826033,"t":"giving information about the development of machine intelligence","c":1,"h":0.017463594953590511,"w":0.61553395589192716,"x":0.15922331321110997},{"x":0.15728155577425174,"w":0.56310679117838547,"t":"indicating which aspects of humans are the most advanced","y":0.41557632415019952,"h":0.017563210840908505,"c":1},{"y":0.44610591877862804,"x":0.069902918459459423,"w":0.55145629882812508,"t":"16 Why does the writer mention the story of King Midas?","h":0.017556872026199932,"c":1},{"x":0.15922329510221994,"y":0.4752906975528326,"w":0.37669904073079424,"c":1,"h":0.01754419320840328,"t":"to compare different visions of progress"},{"h":0.01308139551465759,"c":1,"t":"B","x":0.11650485464991946,"y":0.49563953470737221,"w":0.017475727399190275},{"h":0.01453488311292217,"c":1,"w":0.017475727399190275,"t":"C","x":0.11650485464991943,"y":0.51308139550749243},{"x":0.11650485464991943,"y":0.53343023271679468,"t":"D","h":0.01453488311292217,"w":0.017475727399190275,"c":1},{"x":0.15728155027262167,"w":0.5242718505859375,"h":0.017546910437468144,"c":1,"t":"to illustrate that poorly defined objectives can go wrong","y":0.49408099663968241},{"h":0.015988371899566256,"w":0.37087379455566394,"y":0.51308139543917031,"t":"to emphasise the need for cooperation","x":0.15728154925809032,"c":1},{"w":0.54174758911132814,"t":"to point out the financial advantages of a course of action","c":1,"x":0.15922329275979288,"y":0.53333333339819533,"h":0.016199376947040545},{"c":1,"x":0.069902916227861364,"y":0.56386292841535868,"w":0.64466018676757808,"h":0.017532420529754789,"t":"17 What challenge does the writer refer to in the fourth paragraph?"},{"t":"encouraging humans to behave in a more principled way","x":0.16116504203689611,"h":0.017568644704848424,"y":0.59302325569919356,"w":0.53592234293619789,"c":1},{"w":0.47572814941406238,"t":"deciding which values we want Al to share with us","y":0.61183800628192708,"h":0.017522458941022889,"x":0.15922330383148017,"c":1},{"x":0.16116503660432183,"t":"creating a better world for all creatures on the planet","c":1,"w":0.49708740234374993,"y":0.63081395358165482,"h":0.015988371899566256},{"h":0.018895348284474811,"x":0.11650486562408786,"t":"D ensuring Al is more human-friendly than we are ourselves","y":0.64970930259864534,"c":1,"w":0.59029123942057293},{"w":0.73786407470703119,"t":"18 What does the writer suggest about the future of Al in the fifth paragraph?","c":1,"h":0.017507969627499231,"x":0.069902914005963809,"y":0.68161993745749083},{"x":0.16116503905250582,"y":0.71075581404637356,"w":0.46019419352213553,"t":"The safety of machines will become a key issue.","h":0.016035463208350031,"c":1},{"x":0.15922329297247265,"h":0.016199376947040434,"t":"It is hard to know what impact machines will have on the world.","y":0.72959501553221295,"c":1,"w":0.59805826822916663},{"h":0.01308139551465759,"c":1,"y":0.74854651145155826,"x":0.11650485464991946,"t":"C","w":0.017475727399190275},{"h":0.017494385264744228,"x":0.159223294440649,"c":1,"t":"Machines will be superior to humans in certain respects.","y":0.74704049856221422,"w":0.53592234293619789},{"w":0.53601674397786458,"c":1,"t":"Many humans will oppose machines having a wider role.","y":0.76720851337056506,"x":0.16111764712599466,"h":0.01928615986001081},{"h":0.019003115264797477,"c":1,"w":0.83300969441731765,"x":0.06990292199037014,"t":"19 Which of the following best summarises the writer's argument in the sixth paragraph?","y":0.79501557658525679},{"w":0.59805821736653642,"h":0.017478083672924583,"x":0.16310681922935297,"c":1,"t":"More intelligent machines will result in greater abuses of power.","y":0.8255451714393629},{"x":0.16116504779971347,"y":0.84447674406964657,"w":0.63106796264648435,"h":0.017517025671272557,"t":"Machine learning will share very few features with human learning.","c":1},{"h":0.016016445575844807,"c":1,"y":0.86479750781357811,"x":0.16116504029331111,"w":0.7417475891113281,"t":"There are a limited number of people with the knowledge to program machines."},{"w":0.72815536499023437,"h":0.017466311588465566,"c":1,"x":0.16310678342668666,"t":"Human shortcomings will make creating the machines we need more difficult.","y":0.88224299084529922},{"h":0.015988371899566145,"w":0.029126211802164681,"c":1,"t":"45","x":0.8776699037105683,"y":0.95494186050035101}],"w":2400,"h":3209}